###  https://w3id.org/opxhs/ald-hfo2-capacitor#hasMeasuredValue
:hasMeasuredValue rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                  rdfs:domain :Measurement ;
                  rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
                  rdfs:label "has measured value" .


###  https://w3id.org/opxhs/ald-hfo2-capacitor#hasMetrologyTechniqueName
:hasMetrologyTechniqueName rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
